-- Every mount's speed now follows the rider's riding skill, and these mounts fly only with Expert Riding or
-- better where flying is allowed. Their buff text named a flying speed even where they could not fly, so it now
-- shows only the ground speed until the character knows Expert, Artisan or Extraordinary Riding. The spell
-- description adds the speed for the highest riding rank the character knows and drops the old Outland-only line.

